From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:45:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Send the stream format and the artist image with the
 now-playing media

The now-playing dashboard needs what the stream is (codec, sample rate, bit depth and
bitrate) and an artist portrait to show. Both go in the media's custom data: the format
from the queue item's stream details, and the artist image through the image proxy.
Helpers and their tests come first.
---
